questionText:
A C program is written to take three angles of a triangle as an input and identify whether the formation of triangle is possible or not.

Complete the missing part in the program to achieve the given task.

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
  float a1, a2, a3, sum;
  printf("Enter three angles of a triangle: \n");
  scanf("%f %f %f", &a1, &a2, &a3);

  /* Complete the missing code here */

  return 0;
}
```

modelAnswer:
